<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">What you can use this product for</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">Use this product to help you understand:</p>
        <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
            <li>what products and services exist in DfE, from beta to decommissioned phase</li>
            <li>who to contact to find out about a product or service</li>
            <li>the types of products or services, for example, transactional or information</li>
            <li>the channels used to deliver products or services</li>
            <li>an overview of products and services in each business area or portfolio</li>
            <li>user groups supported for each product or service</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l govuk-!-margin-top-9">Use the product</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            Search the list of products and services by product name, contacts, categories, or user groups.
        </p>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            <a class="govuk-button" href="@Url.Action("Index", "Products")" data-module="govuk-button">Search products and services</a>
        </p>

        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l govuk-!-margin-top-9">Keep information updated</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            Information in this product comes from COMPASS. If information about a product or service is incorrect, and you are named on the product or service, you can manage the information in COMPASS using the 'Manage this information in COMPASS' link on the entry.
        </p>

        <h3 class="govuk-heading-m govuk-!-margin-top-6">Add a missing product or service</h3>
        <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">
            If a product is missing from this register, you need to <a class="govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state" href="https://dfe.service-now.com/mydfe?id=sc_cat_item&sys_id=b97008b81b7680d02fe864606e4bcb9d&table=sc_cat_item" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">create a new service offering in ServiceNow<span class="govuk-visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
